// squad_skirmish — single-target ally heal. AbilityId 2
// (alphabetical slot, between Daze=1 and Strike=3).
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { effects: [EffectOp::Heal { amount: 20.0 }] }.
//
// Used by Soldiers acting as field medics — the verb's `when` clause
// gates on `target.level == self.level` (same-team) and `target.hp <
// 60` (only top up when actually hurt). Score peaks for the lowest-HP
// ally so the multi-target argmax converges on the most-injured
// teammate.

ability Rally {
    target: ally
    range: 8.0
    cooldown: 12
    hint: heal

    heal 20.0 [HEAL: 100]
}
